@AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress = http://localhost:5199

### Health
GET {{AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress}}/api/demo/health

### All members
GET {{AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress}}/api/members

### Member profile (Mike Brady)
GET {{AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress}}/api/members/mbr-1001/profile

### Shares for member
GET {{AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress}}/api/members/mbr-1001/shares

### Share detail with debit cards
GET {{AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress}}/api/shares/shr-3001/detail

### Simulate transfer
POST {{AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress}}/api/demo/transfers/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromShareId": "shr-3001",
  "toShareId": "shr-3002",
  "amount": 7500,
  "memo": "Hackathon demo transfer"
}

### Gemini status
GET {{AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress}}/api/gemini/status

### Gemini chat test
POST {{AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress}}/api/gemini/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Say hello in one short sentence.",
  "systemInstruction": "You are a helpful assistant for an Alkami hackathon demo.",
  "responseAsJson": true
}

### List rules
GET {{AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress}}/api/rules

### Generate rule with Gemini (Mike Brady)
POST {{AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress}}/api/rules/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": "mbr-1001",
  "prompt": "When I transfer more than $500 from checking to Christmas Savings, send me a push notification.",
  "save": true
}

### Rules for member
GET {{AlkamiHackathon.Sandbox_HostAddress}}/api/rules/member/mbr-1001
